weather-summary","display":"Weather Summary"},"content":" \u003cp\u003eFor current weather conditions, see the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.avalanche.ca/map\"\u003etelemetry stations\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003eon the Avalanche Canada map page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor weather forecasts, check out Environment Canada's products for \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.weather.gc.ca/en/location/index.html?coords=51.179,-115.569\"\u003eBanff\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.weather.gc.ca/en/location/index.html?coords=50.950,-116.033\"\u003eKootenay\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.weather.gc.ca/en/location/index.html?coords=51.500,-116.500\"\u003eYoho\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor weather maps, graphics and satellite images check out the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.avalanche.ca/weather/forecast\"\u003eMountain Weather Forecast\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor a technical weather forecast check out \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://spotwx.com/\"\u003eSpotWx\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"}],"dangerRatings":[{"date":{"value":"2026-11-16T18:30:37Z","display":"Monday"},"ratings":{"alp":{"display":"Alpine","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"tln":{"display":"Treeline","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"btl":{"display":"Below Treeline","rating":{"value":"norating","display":"No Rating"}}}},{"date":{"value":"2026-11-17T18:30:37Z","display":"Tuesday"},"ratings":{"alp":{"display":"Alpine","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"tln":{"display":"Treeline","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"btl":{"display":"Below Treeline"