anche-summary","display":"Avalanche Summary"},"content":" \u003cp\u003eThere have been small avalanches on smooth alpine slopes during recent snowfalls.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"type":{"value":"snowpack-summary","display":"Snowpack Summary"},"content":" \u003cp\u003eSnow is slowly starting to accumulate at upper elevations, with approximately 30cm of settled snow at treeline. If you decide to give touring a go, plan for hiking at lower elevations, give yourself lots of extra time, and be cautious where wind deposits have created localized pockets of deep snow.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"type":{"value":"weather-summary","display":"Weather Summary"},"content":" \u003cp\u003eFor current conditions check the telemetry stations by clicking on the weather station icons on the Avalanche Canada map page.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor a weather forecast we recommend Environment Canada's forecast for \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://weather.gc.ca/en/location/index.html?coords=51.301,-117.521\"\u003eRoger's Pass\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor a weather maps, graphics and satellite images check the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://avalanche.ca/weather/forecast\"\u003eMountain Weather Forecast\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor a technical forecast check out SpotWx or Windy\u003c/p\u003e"}],"dangerRatings":[{"date":{"value":"2026-11-11T20:30:16Z","display":"Wednesday"},"ratings":{"alp":{"display":"Alpine","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"tln":{"display":"Treeline","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"btl":{"display":"Below Treeline","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}}}},{"date":{"value":"2026-11-12T20:30:16Z","display":"Thursday"},"ratings":{"alp":{"display":"Alpine","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"tln":{"display":"Treeline","rating":{"value":"earlyseason","display":"Early Season"}},"b